jects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/f021053a-7a5a-45c2-bbee-a572cd5d2081" class="r-h2r6i0" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="7e1e718b-6303-4a62-8f2a-63f3d99fb7a6" class="r-12lwlco"><div data-rid="bbd47b19-9c69-4cec-8456-7e1ff95c407b" class="r-1687kgn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>ZERO GLUE</p></span></div><div data-rid="8405409c-5a5d-44b1-9e13-a119fbe0d4e6" class="r-rsf47y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every layer hand-tufted together in the USA</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="c40cacc0-35da-4ee4-9dbb-e8e85c7a0988" class="r-1aigyjf"><picture data-rid="db5bcb90-d98b-4147-9777-db3ec7935323" class="r-1696jhg"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/c6775fad-b92d-45fa-8c8f-6c69deff791a?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/c6775fad-b92d-45fa-8c8f-6c69deff791a?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/c6775fad-b92d-45fa-8c8f-6c69deff791a?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/c6775fad-b92d-45fa-8c8f-6c69deff791a" class="r-1i8bkug" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="b13160a9-15e5-4ca0-8a32-f0c249b433eb" class="r-119m2xb"><div data-rid="b9d370d4-91d9-4a8c-b4f8-c8a3d04265cf" class="r-143r6g9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>30-YEAR WARRANTY</p></span></div><div data-rid="da912c84-6390-4f88-94c4-722373c274b6" class="r-1hhxwdl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100-Night Risk-Free Trial</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="426cf451-a81b-4faa-9d77-b1bb5324c996" class="r-3zjj7s"><div data-rid="7e9b8dc3-ae59-45c3-8857-9344caad598f" class="r-1rt2vvf"><div data-rid="4d7bba24-1e71-4164-ad8c-f212a7002d44" class="r-1nnsphm"><div data-rid="4c4afc04-32d5-42f2-bf25-d23e577294f1" class="r-17tku6k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>WHAT FOAM DOES AFTER YOU LEAVE THE SHOWROOM</p></span></div><div data-rid="d1e748d2-185c-40d8-bf93-ac986b5c52b8" class="r-13mhr8k"></div><div data-rid="4c16a0f4-5c15-4fc0-8eff-e26e26fdde32" class="r-12py7v0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your Mattress Was Built to Pass a 90-Second Test. You've Been Taking It Every Night for Years.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f91c30f5-7714-4ec7-b189-e0feab8ec3db" class="r-1ue3ys alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most mattresses are designed for one moment: you lie down in the store, sink in, feel the hug and buy it.</p><p><br></p><p>Nobody tests what happens at 3 a.m. Or in year five.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The Ultimate Snooze was built for year five and beyond.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Organic latex springs back instead of sagging. Organic wool keeps you cool and dry. Organic cotton breathes against your skin. And 1,100 pocketed coils hold your spine where it belongs.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>No foam. No glue. No fiberglass. Just a better night's sleep.</strong></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="b889b8ca-853d-4e94-8e04-e6f8ebdead74" class="r-1xyjolu"><div data-rid="00518a1b-cec3-4074-84c9-0b7277aaec2b" class="r-19vf03v"><div class="r-127d0sc" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="1ba32931-7be3-4008-afd7-19bffe632d26" class="r-1ei86pe"><div data-rid="9bd43f7f-ce6b-4ca0-b183-bb4107de862d" class="r-1i1lsw3"><div data-rid="34cd374b-2f59-41bc-bc3b-0fb5c54cde80" class="r-cyfls3"><div data-rid="80aa6bbc-f60e-4227-ae21-0ff539631a35" class="r-1lm7yz0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE SMELL</p></span></div><div data-rid="b3aff37d-bf15-4ffc-a451-490bfa1484c2" class="r-7snlag"></div></div><div data-rid="1dc0351e-68a4-4644-9a79-a10d9d734f97" class="r-1ucfmwh"><div data-rid="4df1cbfd-9251-49c8-b999-044a610ffe59" class="r-1cc5h6w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>That "New Mattress Smell" Has a Chemistry. You've Been Inhaling It Since the Day You Unboxed It.</p></span></div><div data-rid="f699b39e-001b-4676-8cec-225feb9b4551" class="r-1017p50 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There is no such thing as the smell of "new." When a foam mattress smells, you are smelling volatile organic compounds escaping from synthetic foam and adhesives.</p><p><br></p><p>And they don't escape into an empty room. They escape into the six inches of air above the mattress: your breathing zone, for eight hours a night. Research on foam mattresses has found that body heat can raise emissions, so you warm it up and it gives off more.</p><p><br>The Ultimate Snooze is made from cotton, wool and latex. Unwrap it, and there is nothing to air out.<br><br><strong>If your mattress has a smell, it has a story. Most of them aren't good.</strong></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="16924568-cb02-463e-9f12-78247296fe31" class="r-19tqz0m"><div data-rid="d5d1698e-6f87-40ca-8d53-1f9c0f8da8b4" class="r-16if6rb"><div data-rid="ef15c895-0fd1-4b70-88cf-441da623494e" class="r-z8egus alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>1</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="e7a9c08f-60b0-420f-9632-bbefff298d40" class="r-1c1eqg7"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/image_1_-_the_myth_v1.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/image_1_-_the_myth_v1.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/image_1_-_the_myth_v1.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/image_1_-_the_myth_v1.png?v=1791895504" class="r-bxcpj5" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="r-1qd9iwe" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="c0a57c55-a50d-4748-bd31-9964d616aef2" class="r-fzm58i"><div data-rid="33515abd-d0d8-412c-a4ab-c420c94048d0" class="r-yohlwd"><div data-rid="acbd07b8-3822-49a8-a1c6-b84cdc4069d7" class="r-222r62"><div data-rid="2f2ffddb-eb07-49a5-be8d-09f0e867dc63" class="r-s2jn18 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="9394b836-6266-4c18-bc44-876e73408062" class="r-vib939"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/2nd_Image_-_petroluem-refinery-squeeze_mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/2nd_Image_-_petroluem-refinery-squeeze_mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/2nd_Image_-_petroluem-refinery-squeeze_mattress.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/2nd_Image_-_petroluem-refinery-squeeze_mattress.png?v=1791895504" class="r-1fdlov" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="89ef63f3-4a8a-4abb-bf87-38d145d572db" class="r-10ncjkw"><div data-rid="d3d2600a-391d-4f77-b170-114751a520f7" class="r-1bkbvb8"><div data-rid="1c6620e9-f678-4312-b872-dbba4803b22f" class="r-le5de8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE OIL</p></span></div><div data-rid="07292664-e241-4c92-8a65-f0c59b3f04c8" class="r-10336mp"></div></div><div data-rid="1a3a8e13-8a87-4f09-a4c9-fc5a0db41939" class="r-tuw8tq"><div data-rid="9876d9bd-46ce-400d-8dfc-5751c5d0dd0f" class="r-km1d0d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>If You Could Squeeze Your Mattress Like a Sponge, the Ingredient List Would Start at an Oil Refinery.</p></span></div><div data-rid="24266f44-f267-489e-bfc1-c4d809b008de" class="r-r5nbec alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Memory foam is polyurethane: a plastic made from chemicals derived from crude oil, then whipped with blowing agents into foam. It is the same family of material used in car seats and packing inserts.</p><p><br></p><p>You wouldn't sleep on a car seat for ten years. But one-third of your life on petroleum foam is exactly what most mattresses ask of you.</p><p><br></p><p>The Ultimate Snooze replaces every foam layer with materials that grow: certified organic latex from rubber trees, organic wool from sheep, organic cotton from fields.<br><br><strong>You don't need a better foam. You need no foam.</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="r-113fre7" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="0225102a-35ea-4164-89bf-c6c054c3da9d" class="r-2ncbne"><div data-rid="f3c4972f-68f5-4f99-b18b-cf2e4e1f0a9e" class="r-6y119b"><div data-rid="ae961263-57fd-47b7-b653-439bdc7a5001" class="r-yu8aoa"><div data-rid="b8450e0e-0e48-4f49-8b18-b70d5bc7a9b5" class="r-1xcj10w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>THE HEAT</p></span></div><div data-rid="c1324f9d-eab4-4949-9269-a0c5fd0ed341" class="r-tnp6ht"></div></div><div data-rid="def4338e-4d26-4467-a0f6-3e07d657b847" class="r-13sj4v"><div data-rid="32a1b20e-eab7-4d4d-9686-d8b128de1be3" class="r-r07p3u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your Mattress Has a Fever Every Night. It's Yours.</p></span></div><div data-rid="5081983c-2f54-45af-ab49-810a91be526f" class="r-15d745r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Memory foam is designed to soften with body heat. That's how it "hugs" you. The catch: the deeper you sink, the less air moves around you, and the more of your own heat the foam stores and hands back.</p><br><p>That's the 3 a.m. pattern: kick off the covers, flip the pillow, stick a leg out, lie awake. Your body needs to cool down to stay in deep sleep, and it's lying in an insulator.</p><br><p>The Ultimate Snooze breathes from top to bottom. Wool wicks moisture away. Pinhole-perforated latex moves air. 1,100 pocketed coils keep air circulating underneath.</p><br></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="69155b91-3624-4a1a-a070-25cfd376a0b4" class="r-con9x"><div data-rid="e86ce3e2-144c-4433-84d0-5b27375cbac4" class="r-17tr9p0"><div data-rid="4ce890ca-525b-481a-a6a1-f8e1309e5cd6" class="r-xjvwnd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="5815cd2d-abdc-4339-8ff8-0c2d9035fa02" class="r-17p12al"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/3rd_Image_-_Heat.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/3rd_Image_-_Heat.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/3rd_Image_-_Heat.png?v=1791895504&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/9721/1457/files/3rd_Image_-_Heat.png?v=1791895504" class="r-1cl3v3h" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><div data-rid="f316fc6f-549b-4917-8c7f-41100cfa491e" class="r-1fqrvq2"><div data-rid="b5ad795e-81f0-42d6-a25c-e3f796464642" class="r-1l1w9kq"><div data-rid="2ebae233-6303-4a64-a1a6-9bcff94bb461" class="r-12fpxra alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most People Never Ask What's Inside Their Mattress. Then They Find Out.</p></span></div><div data-rid="c0898837-cd68-4491-98d1-d12c5b76a9b1" class="r-qjz4e2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You read the label on your protein powder. You filter your water. You check the ingredients on your kid's snacks.<br><br>Then you lie face-down for a third of your life on something you have never once looked inside.<br><br>Conventional memory foam was engineered to feel good for ninety seconds in a showroom. Here are the 8 things it does over the next ten years.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="48906af8-9682-432f-8a8f-343db5a59a00" class="r-1jf68hn" id="replo-carousel::R95b2:" role="region" aria-label="Carousel" data-replo-carousel="true"><div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="r